# Correct: EBK-style kriging (subsets of 100 points, simulated semivariograms, 15 neighbours) and an L1
# logistic MaxEnt-type model with hinge features; the global probability raster keeps only cells whose
# centre lies inside the shallow waters (centre-based mask instead of all-touched).
# The steps run as separate blocks in one namespace; a block that raises is skipped.
